# Oviya, Automech Artisan: "{G}, {T}: You may put a creature or Vehicle card from your hand onto the battlefield. If you put an
# artifact onto the battlefield this way, put two +1/+1 counters on it." Turn 3 puts Veloheart Bike (an artifact Vehicle) onto the
# battlefield: it enters (Bot1 gains 2) and gets two counters; a Lightning Bolt is not a creature or Vehicle card, so it cannot be
# chosen. Turn 5 puts Memnite (an artifact creature) onto the battlefield with two counters, 3/3 (CR 608.2d, 205.2a).
# A card put onto the battlefield is not cast, so no mana is paid for either.

